https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Some things to consider:\r\n\r\n- As a function, this is a pretty niché feature with limited usefulness. Even godot-benchmarks can instead infer its own build system information, instead of querying it from this function. I don't think it's needed for this usecase. \r\n- A better use-case might be providing this information for bug reports. It could be dumped in the logs, or shown in some debug info editor UI for a quick check. I believe this would be more aligned with https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10788.\r\n- Exposing this information is a (very) minor security risk. With more information, it may be easier for serious hackers to infer information about the binary, and possibly exploit version specific compiler bugs. I agree with @Mickeon; I think this information should not be included in release builds. Developers should already be aware of the exact builds they use, and won't need this information.\r\n\r\nI can't really comment on the implementation regarding buildsystem. But it looks like the tests are failing at the moment.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98845#pullrequestreview-3312029803","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98845","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98845#pullrequestreview-3312029803"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98845"}},"submitted_at":"2025-10-07T21:42:24Z","commit_id":"19e2b2eb07e56fec4da046d6c8874886267e8187"}]